OL,3,GNEWSAWindsor Castle's Christmas        
OL,4,Adecorations unveiled                   
OL,6,FA Christmas tree decorated with        
OL,7,Fthousands of lights and ornaments has  
OL,8,Ftaken pride of place at Windsor Castle.
OL,10,FVisitors can celebrate the season at   
OL,11,Fthe castle, and visit decorated rooms  
OL,12,Fincluding its Crimson Drawing Room,    
OL,13,Funtil 4 January.                       
OL,15,FThe 20ft (6.1m) Christmas tree in St   
OL,16,FGeorge's Hall was grown in Windsor     
OL,17,FGreat Park nearby, while a 16ft (4.9m) 
OL,18,Ftree has been placed in the Crimson    
OL,19,FDrawing Room for people to enjoy.      
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
