OL,3,GNEWSAWindsor Castle's Christmas        
OL,4,Adecorations unveiled                   
OL,6,FOther attractions include the Queen    
OL,7,FMary's Dolls' House, the largest and   
OL,8,Fmost famous dolls' house in the world. 
OL,9,FThat includes a scaled-down Christmas  
OL,10,Ftree inside it, decorated with         
OL,11,Fornaments made from glass beads        
OL,12,Frepurposed from vintage necklaces.     
